[2026-03-29 01:26:44] Investigated SYSEXC root cause before restoring full mask.
- Reviewed FPU init and FPSCR helpers in TM4C129E_DriverLib.
- Verified FPU__enInit enables/configures the FPU but does not clear pending FPSCR exception flags.
- Verified SYSEXC__enInit disables/enables sources but does not clear pending SYSEXC interrupt status before enabling the vector.
